  "corpus_revision": "provenance-audit-consent-qualification-v1",
  "notes": [
    "This corpus validates FHIR R4 core syntax and invariants only. Provenance expresses generation/derivation context; AuditEvent records security-relevant usage; Consent is a policy representation, not an enforcement engine.",
    "The valid inactive Consent case is intentionally syntactically valid but must not be interpreted as an active authorization grant. Mycelix must independently resolve current authority, consent status, signature/legal-policy requirements, purpose, recipient, action, time, and revocation."
  ]
